{
  "_comment": [
    "The frozen detectors of the held-out tests (docs/protocol-heldout.md, section 6),",
    "read by tools/run_heldout.py. Each entry: `detector` (learned, stalta, filterpicker,",
    "transformer), `args` (ayzek options, without --detector), and for a published model",
    "`model`, `weights`, `mode` (tools/seisbench_scores.py, its cache replacing the learned",
    "detector's own networks through --scores-in). `stalta_station`: the per-station",
    "baseline, `ratios` naming each network group's station,ratio file (--stalta-on-stations)",
    "and `on` the ratio of stations without one. `TBD` marks a setting the retuning has",
    "not yet delivered; run_heldout refuses to run with one."
  ],
  "learned": {
    "detector": "learned",
    "args": []
  },
